{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I Hate Seagulls&quot; is a chaotic third-person flying game where you play as a seagull on a mission to be the worst seagull imaginable. Soar through the skies, snatch sandwiches, scream at strangers, and rain down poop from above. Your goal? Fly fast, steal everything, and leave a glorious trail of mayhem.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/25_04_21_Steal_Hotdog_Steam.gif?t=1745411897\" />Live the ultimate seagull life. Enjoy hot dogs!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/25_04_22_Guard_Sandwich_Birds.gif?t=1745411897\" />Not all Seagulls are friends. make friends or steal from rivals.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/25_04_22_Steal_Sandwich_Birds.gif?t=1745411897\" />Use the environment to take down your rivals.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/extras/25_04_22_Attack_Lady_Balcony.gif?t=1745411897\" />Gather your flock and strike as one! <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604480?t=1745411897","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/a28f399eea67c74b522bcb0c1dbb9d0952a73af0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745411897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/d7104a3bafbfbaa344d801257c3e98cd29c83074/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745411897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604480/d7104a3bafbfbaa344d801257c3e98cd29c83074/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745411897","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"